@startuml
title State Diagram — HU3: Catalog Management (Administrator ↔ System messages)

' Refines the context-state CATALOG_MANAGEMENT (HU3).
' Actors: Business Administrator <-> System.

state "CATALOG_PANEL" as panel
state "SERVICE_CREATED" as service
state "EMPLOYEE_CREATED" as employee
state "SERVICE_ASSIGNED\n(visible in public widget)" as assigned
state "DELETION_BLOCKED\n(service with future appointments)" as blocked

[*] --> panel : Admin→System: openCatalog

panel --> service : Admin→System: createService(name, price, duration)
panel --> employee : Admin→System: createEmployee

service --> assigned : Admin→System: assignServiceToEmployee(EmployeeX)\n/ System: link, publishToWidget
employee --> assigned : Admin→System: assignServiceToEmployee(EmployeeX)

assigned --> blocked : Admin→System: deleteService\n[has future appointments] / System: preventDeletion, notifyAdmin
blocked --> assigned : System→Admin: serviceDeactivated(without deleting appointments)

assigned --> [*] : Admin→System: closeCatalog

note right of employee
  Employee with no assigned services:
  the System does not expose it as a
  selectable option in the widget.
end note
@enduml
